OL,3,AGoogle value plunges by $500bn as its
OL,4,Aown AI search hits ad sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle-owner Alphabet lost just over
OL,7,F$500bn (#374bn) in value on Thursday
OL,8,Fafter it revealed its own artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) summaries were
OL,10,Fhitting search advertising revenue.
OL,12,FChief business officer Philipp
OL,13,FSchindler said Google's "AI mode",
OL,14,Fwhere it answers questions
OL,15,Fconversationally, was eating into the
OL,16,Fmoney it makes from ads which appear
OL,17,Fnext to results to traditional search
OL,18,Fquestions.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
