OL,3,AGoogle value plunges by $500bn as its
OL,4,Aown AI search hits ad sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FYet, Schindler said he felt "very good
OL,7,Fabout our trajectory" with an
OL,8,FAI-focused version of the search
OL,9,Fengine.
OL,11,FGoogle's role in answering the world's
OL,12,Fquestions has been challenged by the AI
OL,13,Fboom, with millions of people using
OL,14,Fprograms such as ChatGPT and Claude
OL,15,Finstead.
